@startuml koppeltaal-medmij-uc-9-10-11-12

skinparam roundcorner 20
skinparam defaultFontName Arial 
hide footbox

!pragma teoz true

actor  Patient as "Vera"
actor  Doctor as "GP Dr. West"
participant  HIS as "gp-system"
participant ZH1 as "zh1"
participant GGZ as "ggz"
participant  PGO1 as "pgo1"

Patient -> GGZ: Patient Makes Appointment
GGZ -> HIS: Task-8 Notify
GGZ -> PGO1: Task-8 Notify
HIS -> HIS: Update CarePlan
GGZ -> PGO1: Creer/Post Task9a (Vragenlijst Ernst van de Angst)
PGO1 -> Patient: Notificeer Patient
Patient -> PGO1: Invullen Angst Inventarisatie Vragenlijst
PGO1 -> PGO1: Task9a complete
PGO1 -> GGZ: Task9a complete
GGZ -> PGO1: Creer/Post Task9b (Module Behandeling Angst)
PGO1 -> Patient: Notificeer Patient
Patient -> PGO1: Opvolgen Module Behandeling Angst
PGO1 -> PGO1: Task9b complete
PGO1 -> GGZ: Task9b complete
GGZ -> PGO1: Creer/Post Task9c (Vragenlijst Meting behandeleffect)
PGO1 -> Patient: Notificeer Patient
Patient -> PGO1: Invullen Vragenlijst behandeleffect
PGO1 -> PGO1: Task9c complete
PGO1 -> GGZ: Task9c complete
GGZ -> HIS: Task-8 complete
Doctor -> ZH1: Make Careplan MRI (etc)
@enduml